{"id":"483486","name":"木耳佛手瓜汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/483486/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"佛手瓜","amount":"4个"},{"name":"干木耳","amount":"15g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"3根"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"无花果","amount":"5个"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"佛手瓜去皮去核，切小块。","img":"images/483486/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄豆用水泡30分钟。","img":"images/483486/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"木耳用温水泡发，洗净。","img":"images/483486/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"无花果用水冲洗一下。","img":"images/483486/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗去浮沫。","img":"images/483486/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮切小段。","img":"images/483486/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把以上所有材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤功能键开煮。","img":"images/483486/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮好排气后就可打开盖子，放盐调味即可。","img":"images/483486/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"清润降脂。","img":"images/483486/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}